  "body": "Experience the perfect blend of timeless charm and contemporary style when you step inside this beautifully renovated 1950’s character cottage. Tucked away on a sun-soaked, freehold section, this is a home that feels as welcoming as it is private.\r\n\r\nIt’s a true retreat, yet right in the centre of everything Takapuna has to offer: Walk to top schools - Westlake Boys and Westlake Girls, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Takapuna Primary, (all in zone), Rosmini College, and St Joseph’s Primary, with Takapuna Grammar a short drive.  Buses, supermarkets, cafes, and the iconic Takapuna Beach are all just flat a stroll away, making daily life effortless and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, you’ll be drawn to the effortless indoor-outdoor flow. French doors and double bi-folds open out onto expansive decking, inviting you to entertain friends, bask in the sun, or simply relax in your own private sanctuary, surrounded by established greenery.\r\n\r\nInside, you’ll find a stunning, newly renovated kitchen that will inspire your inner chef. Featuring sleek engineered stone benchtops and premium Fisher & Paykel appliances, every detail has been thoughtfully considered for both style and function. The open-plan living and dining spaces are welcoming with beautiful NZ hardwood floors throughout, light-filled, and just perfect for cosy evenings or lively gatherings.\r\n\r\nTwo generous double bedrooms provide restful retreats, each with ample wardrobe space. The bathroom is a real showstopper—modern, funky, and highly practical, complete with twin vanities, a shower-over-bath, and a cleverly integrated laundry area.\r\n\r\nThe new 234m2 freehold title is on its way! This is a home that welcomes you from the very first moment—where comfort, style, and convenience come together in perfect harmony. Ready to make your move? Contact us today and step into your new Takapuna lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
